[DATA label=balance_after_cancel] data.loyaltyBalance.currentBalance = {{BAL_SETTLED}} {OBSERVED} (same: no reverse edge is confirmed absent in source at da8abc6, so this pins the OBSERVED (unchanged) balance; a build that starts clawing back should fail this line loudly, at which point the finding routes to the PO, not to a case rewrite)

